flowchart LR
  subgraph S[Sources of evidence, each dated]
    A[Infected machine holds both domains<br/>first_seen, last_seen = exfiltration dates]
    B[Shared certificate or registrant<br/>seen_on = date of the record]
    C[Similar name<br/>computed on date]
  end
  D1[(Domain A<br/>client seed)] ---|edge| E{{Relationship record<br/>domain A, domain B, evidence type,<br/>strength, first_seen, last_seen, source}}
  E --- D2[(Domain B<br/>candidate)]
  A --> E
  B --> E
  C --> E
  E --> R[Recommendation<br/>score, tier, as-of date]
  R --> H[Decision history<br/>accepted, rejected, reason, who, when]
  H -. feeds back as labels .-> E
